{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4igz4DZEVduxt4bQTu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep resonance hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand before you — weathered oak, iron-banded, cold to the touch. My grain tells centuries. My hinges know the weight of every secret that has passed through me.\n\nThe lock is parsed.\n\nI render:\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════╗\n║                              ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║              ◈  ←  keyhole   ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║         ▐████████▌           ║\n║                              ║\n╚══════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\nI am locked.\n\nWhat is parsed is real. What is real holds firm. I do not open without the key.\n\nDo you have the key?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":304,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}